B8|I/O|PC14-OSC32_IN||RCC_OSC32_IN GPIO
C1|I/O|PA11||ADC1_EXTI11 ADC2_EXTI11 CAN_RX TIM1_CH4 USART1_CTS USB_DM GPIO
C2|I/O|PA12||CAN_TX TIM1_ETR USART1_RTS USB_DP GPIO
