C4|I/O|PC12||SDIO_CK UART5_TX USART3_CK GPIO
C5|I/O|PB7||I2C1_SDA TIM4_CH2 USART1_RX GPIO
C6|Power|VBAT||
C7|Reset|NRST||
C8|I/O|PC13-TAMPER-RTC||RTC_OUT RTC_TAMPER GPIO
